Simulate physics in the Scene.
Call this to simulate physics manually when the simulation mode is set to Script. Simulation includes all the stages of collision detection, rigidbody and joints integration, and filing of the physics callbacks (contact, trigger and joints). Calling Physics.Simulate does not cause FixedUpdate to be called.
